        "korean": "Dear priest 고백할 게 있어\n피 한 방울과 tears\n그저 연극일 뿐",
        "romanization": "Dear priest gobaekhal ge isseo\npi han bangulgwa tears\ngeujeo yeongeugil ppun",
        "english": "Dear priest, I have a confession to make\nWith a drop of blood and tears\nIt’s just a play",
